{
  "description": "Single-defect export reports (E169 s0): each case applies its edits to a valid report (valid/<base>.json; set replaces or adds the value at the path, delete removes it) and names the code and JSON path of mapper.check_export_report. by: schema means export-report-schema.json refuses it too (JSON Schema Draft 2020-12); by: validator means only mapper.py does, and the schema admits it.",
